Strategic Benefits: Selecting the Right Cases
​Objective ROI Mapping: Eliminates guesswork by identifying cases that offer the highest value and lowest effort for automation.
​100% Feasibility Guarantee: Prevents "Automation Dead-ends" by pre-validating if a case is technically compatible with Web or Desktop tools before coding begins.
​Risk-Aligned Prioritization: Ensures critical and high-impact business modules are automated first, providing the best protection for the application.
​Reduced Development Waste: Saves engineering hours by filtering out cases that are technically unstable or provide low business value.
​Technology-Specific Strategy: Automatically suggests the best automation approach by distinguishing between Web UI and Desktop application requirements.
​Accelerated Digital Transformation: Speeds up the transition from manual to automated testing by providing a clear, ranked roadmap for the team.
​Standardized Selection Criteria: Creates a consistent framework for all teams to use when deciding which cases enter the automation backlog.
​Optimized Tool Utilization: Matches the test case complexity with the specific capabilities of your UI and Desktop automation tools.
